            "review_title": "Review at Lobby Bar and Café at Radisson Hotel",
            "review_text": "Simon L\n13 contributions\n0\nTruly Memorable Hospitality at Radisson Đà Nẵng\nJun 2026 • Family\nWe had a wonderful experience at the Lobby Cafe at Radisson Hotel Đà Nẵng. The atmosphere was elegant, relaxing, and perfect for enjoying a coffee or light meal. \n\nThe ice cream is delicious, beautifully presented, and full of flavor.\n\nWhat made the visit truly exceptional was the outstanding service from the staff.\n\nA special thanks to Thư, Phú and Tùng who were incredibly attentive, warm, and professional throughout my visit. They made us feel genuinely welcomed and went above and beyond to ensure everything was perfect. Their kindness, efficiency, and hospitality truly deserve 5 stars.\n\nIt’s rare to meet staff who can make such a strong positive impression. Because of them, we will definitely come back and highly recommend this place to anyone visiting Đà Nẵng.\nRead more\nWritten June 14, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
