            "review_text": "Jack M\nBowness-on-Windermere, United Kingdom24 contributions\n0\nGreat coffee shop\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe popped into the hotel for coffee which was very reasonably priced twice whist staying in Danang and Khe who served us both days had excellent English and was a pleasure to chat to. She went out of her way to make more fresh croissants for us. Will return. Khe is an excellent ambassador for the hotel and should be rewarded as such.\nInsider tip:\nGo to the coffee shop\nValue\nRooms\nLocation\nCleanliness\nService\nSleep Quality\nWritten November 10, 2024",
